        "chapter": 25,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "And now it came to pass that when Mosiah had made an end of speaking and reading to the people, he desired that Alma should also speak to the people.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 14,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Mosiah 25:14",
        "book": "Mosiah",
        "chapter": 25,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "And Alma did speak unto them, when they were assembled together in large bodies, and he went from one body to another, preaching unto the people repentance and faith on the Lord.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 15,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Mosiah 25:15",
        "book": "Mosiah",
        "chapter": 25,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "And he did exhort the people of Limhi and his brethren, all those that had been delivered out of bondage, that they should remember that it was the Lord that did deliver them.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 16,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Mosiah 25:16",
        "book": "Mosiah",
        "chapter": 25,
        "verse": 16
      },
